=== PREFLIGHT ===
before marking phase 10 STATUS=DONE.

env_var_contract_for_prompt_10:
  API_LOG_CAPTURE_BODIES (bool, default false). When false, RequestBody and
  ResponseBody columns are written as NULL even on the inbound middleware path.
  When true, both bodies are captured up to 10 KB (10240 bytes) each, redacted,
  and stored. Operator default at deployment is OFF (matches phase 38-08 ADR
  decision BODY_CAPTURE_DEFAULT=off).

backpressure_contract_for_prompt_10:
  Channel size: 1024 entries (rationale: ~1024 in-flight requests is well above
  any realistic single-pod inbound concurrency; smaller risks dropping in burst,
  larger risks unbounded memory). On queue.full / writer.full / writer.queue.full
  the middleware drops the entry, calls metrics.APICallLogDrops.Inc(), and emits
  a rate-limited zerolog.Warn() (no panic, no error returned to caller).

